      lines.push('COPY-FRIENDLY OUTPUT: Put ONE complete JSON object inside ONE ```json code block, with NO introduction, explanation, or other text before or after it. Use the AI chat\'s Copy code button to copy ONLY the JSON payload in one tap (not the surrounding backticks). If the AI interface cannot show a Copy code button, return ONLY the raw JSON object without code fences. The dashboard Import → Paste copied JSON flow also recognizes fenced JSON when copied as text.');
      lines.push('JSON FORMAT: The object inside the code block must be valid JSON: no comments, trailing commas, placeholders, unescaped newlines inside strings, or multiple JSON objects. Top-level "format" must equal "'+format.format+'"; ONLY "'+format.array+'" is allowed as a populated study-material array. Other material arrays must be absent.');
